{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"be8ad427522b1ca2d3d5cd6b93421f2f16b32012364b7fced62ba085ecad0d1e","ja":"もうすぐ記念公演　～お祭りの心構え～","zh":"纪念公演即将开始　～祭典的心理准备～","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"b74b53bf33385ca5e0b2ad2922d7eebb13f4fbacd6eb096cd8206dfd78c26366","ja":"もっと脇を締めて、バッチリウインク……こうっ！！\nうんうん。過去イチの可愛さを更新しちゃったね♪","zh":"把手臂再收紧一点，完美地眨个眼……这样！！\n嗯嗯，刷新了至今为止最可爱的表现呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"921d237d6e905d0e3537d72b3007c957c15e02946374ff362743117d605a7b24","ja":"お疲れ様です、茜さん。\n見かけないと思ったら、こんなところにいたんですね。","zh":"辛苦了，茜小姐。\n还以为没看到你，原来你在这种地方啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3f46582b3dc33504f2f80a01cb069c60e0dd1d797bf0f98cc36459fe7c0af8e1","ja":"まったく。レッスンをサボってると思ったら、\n鏡の前で変なポーズなんかして……。","zh":"真是的。还以为你在偷懒不训练，结果却在镜子前摆些奇怪的姿势……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"dbd655e31fea3b20490964d9183d3d620cdc48a6411c87e49b72c3d27c60e19e","ja":"律子さん、しほりん！　これは変なポーズじゃなくて、\n記念公演に向けたウォーミングアップだよ！","zh":"律子姐、志保！这不是奇怪的姿势，而是为纪念公演做的热身哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1768fadbefc83e160ad69cd6b9c6efd79f3e5c748ea5df100b15b83c2c6df32c","ja":"本番で最強にカワイイ茜ちゃんを披露するための\n大事な特訓なのです！　しほりんも一緒にどうかにゃ？","zh":"这是为了在正式演出中展现最最可爱的小茜而进行的重要特训！志保也一起来吗，喵？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d96634620b36eea0df207579dfda7972c6cd760dfe4c5f507d6967d7c7338842","ja":"遠慮しておきます。記念公演は成長を見せる場です。\n本番に向けてやるべきことは、まだ沢山あるので……。","zh":"我就不参加了。纪念公演是展示成长的舞台。\n为了正式演出，还有很多该做的事情……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"9f89231c9e84af46bd9c5ab9500b0004ac02dfd2f87a9276ea91ccc64c80e47e","ja":"記念公演の捉え方は、人それぞれだけど……\n志保は、少し堅苦しく考えすぎじゃないかしら？","zh":"每个人对纪念公演的理解都不一样……\n但志保是不是想得有点太严肃了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"40dd7b8dde40d214b1d2fe2297dc1f4523e12fc5dd92de409fff07a6e327de5d","ja":"事務所のアイドル総出演の公演だからこそ、\nお祭りを楽しむような気持ちでもいいと思うわよ。","zh":"正因为是事务所偶像全员出演的公演，我觉得抱着享受节日庆典的心情也没关系哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"2078aac57d70986ad5e6b3772182fe7c9a357ba0f5f9603dc1f93c55ac05de12","ja":"お祭りを楽しむ……ですか？","zh":"享受祭典……吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"69a65c91b8e10cb659c74fc7f70873ba61ad80e8f3278b19ba233ef8844958ad","ja":"そうそう！　特別だからこそ、思いきり楽しまなきゃ♪\nだからしほりんも、一緒にポーズの研究しようよ！","zh":"对对！正因为特别，才更要尽情享受嘛♪\n所以志保也一起研究摆什么姿势吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d18d95a91d248534860b3e4178b73c9097ca7034af8904a6be2633f6d80b35fe","ja":"それは、お断りします。","zh":"这个，我拒绝。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"274eb93a36d13b869c92ca3a26d897df639ecfa3612d0dd332c3d253e7adde1e","ja":"ところで茜は、\n随分、時間を持て余してるみたいね？","zh":"话说回来，茜好像很闲呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"844e5e0390bb0befe5c89a727b654c8e577f9df6b4d33596e1f5e602c2ff9491","ja":"サボった分と合わせて、\n今から地獄のレッスンを……。","zh":"加上偷懒落下的部分，\n从现在开始进行地狱式训练……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"6ae8f3b7996b87cd6da9bebd62e50ac5a8afab303deca0635cb8039398154735","ja":"にゃッ！？　あ、ああ～……思い出した！\n茜ちゃん、大事な用事があったんだ～……それじゃ！","zh":"喵！？啊、啊啊～……想起来了！小茜，我还有重要的事要办呢～……那就先走啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"184ccc40ee6a741b0d5c99b20305b9d1b95ea1cde5bce93c286c869b9216410a","ja":"こらーッ！？　待ちなさい、茜ー！！","zh":"喂——！？给我站住，茜——！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_881.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"6f7df62d6a9eb26c5fa951f75afd0d80e24434dee18a7e7e98d4f16f7bbefaba","ja":"あの、律子さん……行っちゃった。でも、楽しむ\n気持ちか……。私なりに、意識してみようかな。","zh":"那个，律子……已经走了。不过，享受的心情吗……我是不是也该试着用自己的方式去留意一下呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
